 "remarks": "Fabulous sun-filled 2-bedroom, 2.1-bath end-unit townhouse with a wraparound private deck at the sought-after Hawthorne Association, right in the heart of downtown Glenville. Enjoy an open floor plan with a cozy fireplace and exceptional private outdoor space, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Generously sized bedrooms include a primary suite with dual walk-in closets, cathedral ceilings. Recent updates include new Pella French doors, flooring, carpeting, and hot water heater. One-car garage with space for an additional vehicle, plus guest parking. Prime location with easy access to local shops, dining, fitness studios, parks, downtown Greenwich, Westchester Airport, and more.",
